# Secrets for Vercel and Node. Vercel: Project Settings → Environment Variables (`vercel env add`); Node: the
# server's environment (locally `node --env-file=.env.local server/entry.node.js`).
# Signs internal requests (jobs, `hypdriv audit` tokens). 32+ random bytes.
HYPDRIV_INTERNAL_SECRET=
# Encrypts Hypdriv sessions. 32+ random bytes.
HYPDRIV_SESSION_SECRET=
# Vercel Cron sends `Authorization: Bearer $CRON_SECRET`.
CRON_SECRET=
# The public origin of the site: Qwik uses it for the CSRF origin check behind a proxy and for canonical URLs and
# sitemap.xml during static generation (Hypdriv falls back to `site.origin` in hypdriv.config.ts).
# ORIGIN=https://www.example.com
